<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="keywords" content="诗歌">
    <title>1_poem.html</title>
    <style>
        body {background: #F4F4F4;margin: 0;padding: 20px;}
        h1, h3 {text-align: center;margin: 10px 0;}
        hr {border: 3px dotted #F0A95D;margin: 10px 0;}
        table {border: none;margin: 0 auto;}
        td {border: none;padding: 20px;vertical-align: middle;text-align: center;}
        td img {max-width: 300px; height: auto;}
        .s {background: url(./cracker.jpeg) no-repeat left; min-width: 300px;}
        .p p {color: #CA000B;font-family: "仿宋";font-size: 20px;line-height: 1.8;margin: 5px 0;} 
        audio {display: block;margin: 20px auto;}
        .f {text-align: center;margin-top: 20px;} 
        .f a {color: red;text-decoration: none;}
        .f a:hover {text-decoration: underline;}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>元日</h1><h3>宋代：王安石</h3><hr>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <td class="s">
                <div class="p">
                    <p>爆竹声中一岁除，</p><p>春风送暖入屠苏。</p><p>千门万户曈曈日，</p><p>总把新桃换旧符。</p>
                </div>
            </td>
            <td>
                <img src="./01.png" alt="spring">
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    <audio controls><source src="./music.mp3"></audio>
